      "comment": "SHANNY ROSE (1) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 305m behind Huntsman (18.26) in a Grade 3/4/5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to her credit. Can make amends. CADILLAC LANDAU (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (18.39) in a Other at this track. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. COMPTON LAYLA (8) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (18.08) at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MAGIC POPPY (4) is fresh from a short break and ready to run well.",
